    <sys:String x:Key="Set_About">About</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set_AboutDesc">Data comes from public endpoints of Yahoo Finance, CBOE, Nasdaq, CNBC, SEC, Sina, Tencent and Eastmoney. It may be delayed, interrupted or wrong. For reference only, not investment advice. Free public sources do not provide Level 2 order book (bid/ask depth) or tick-by-tick trades, so the app shows last price, volume and bars only. Follow each source's terms and do not redistribute the data commercially. Closing the main window hides the app in the tray; right-click the tray icon and choose Exit to quit.</sys:String>
