    <sys:String x:Key="Mac_AlDesc">When last price, change percent, volume or IV crosses a level you set, a banner appears in the window, a macOS notification is posted and the Dock icon bounces. Closing the window keeps the app running in the Dock and alerts keep checking; ⌘Q quits.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mac_ShortcutsDesc">⌘1…⌘9 switch to Overview, Watchlist, K-line, Options, Strategy, News, Alerts, Data Sources, Settings; ⌘R refreshes the page; ⌘F or typing outside a text box opens the keyboard wizard; ⌘E exports the current table; ⌘, opens Settings; ⌘W closes the window (the app keeps running in the Dock); ⌘Q quits.</sys:String>
